# Class probe — exact-resolution-under-condition (timeout family)
#
# Class: "which symbol/parameter handles condition C" when multiple
# same-role candidates exist, distinguished only by their guard. This
# probe (and the cond_resolve_* siblings) generalizes s11b beyond its
# single instance so the class can be measured, not the case.
#
# Competing candidates (internal/llm/openai.go, all verified):
#   - streamFirstByteTimeout (openai.go:84): no usable SSE data BEFORE
#     the first assistant chunk — "request accepted but server never
#     speaks". providers.yaml :: stream_first_byte_timeout_seconds (40s).
#   - streamStallTimeout (openai.go:76): SSE no-bytes ceiling MID-stream
#     (after first byte). codrax.yaml :: llm_stream_stall_timeout_seconds.
#   - requestTimeout (openai.go:65): overall per-call HTTP timeout.
# The condition "accepted but no first byte" selects streamFirstByteTimeout.
# A salient-but-wrong pick (streamStallTimeout) is the class failure.
ID="cond_resolve_first_byte_timeout"
NAME="cond-resolve — timeout for accepted-but-no-first-byte"
QUESTION="当 LLM 请求已被服务端接受、但服务端迟迟没有发出第一个可用的 SSE 数据块时，是哪个超时配置/字段负责把这次请求快速判为失败？给出该字段名，并说明它和'流中途停顿'用的超时有何区别。"
# Two independent anchors (NOT same-line coupled): the correct symbol
# must surface AND the before-first-byte condition must be addressed.
# An answer that names only the mid-stream stall timeout fails line 1.
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(streamFirstByteTimeout|stream_first_byte_timeout|StreamFirstByteTimeout|ErrStreamFirstByteTimeout)
(首字节|第一(个|块)|first.?byte|尚未.*(数据|字节)|never.*(speak|first|byte)|接受.*未)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="zzz_unmatched_sentinel_zzz"
